# Bastion scripts — forward guard. Earlier iterations generated
# infra/setup-bastion.ps1 and infra/cleanup-bastion.ps1 with hardcoded
# EC2/SG/VPC-endpoint IDs and printed the DB secret to stdout. The scripts
# have been removed; this pattern prevents accidental re-commit if anyone
# regenerates them.
